Blogging Website Setup Steps
Step 1: Go to this URL: https://github.com/shriyashetty25/blogging-website/
Step 2: Search for a button named Code in green color.
Step 3: Click on it. There is an option to Download ZIP. Download that ZIP and unzip it on your laptop.
Step 4: Then go inside that folder and double-click on start.bat. It will start working. If not, contact the developer.
